PLAN P14<-E1 op=insert at=flight-sim3.html#"jet budget: meshes=" why=merge-static-jet-parts spec="add mergeStaticJetChildren(root, exclude) called in makeJet just before the budget audit: walks root, collects Mesh children whose material is opaque MeshStandardMaterial AND not inside gearNose/gearL/gearR subtrees AND not referenced (self or ancestor) by any root.userData value AND not transparent/additive/emissive-animated; groups by material.uuid; for each group >=2 meshes: bake each mesh's matrix (updateWorldMatrix relative to root) into cloned geometry (position+normal transformed, uv/color preserved; index expanded to non-indexed if mixed), concat manually (pattern already in file from greebles merge), one merged Mesh per material added to root, originals removed; ALSO per gear group: merge static strut-side meshes (strut+scissor+brace+doors) into one mesh per gear preserving grp.userData.strut ref (re-point to merged mesh's parent group), and merge each wheel assembly (tire+hub+studs+disc) into one spinning mesh preserving grp.userData.wheel; target meshes<=90 materials unchanged; re-log audit" test="boot: console jet budget meshes<=90; orchestrator reruns V3" order=14
